{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2016-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1471996800, "end_date": 1472687999, "month_true_total": 36, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:52:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "25268668", "author": {"steamid": "76561198186775833", "personaname": "RememberHiroshima", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DoDudz/", "num_games_owned": 108, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 681, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 392, "last_played": 1699461416, "avatar": "2270a83a8650a1748600d1bf57c55e53a33e4180"}, "language": "english", "review": "-Gets a super power axe\n-58328819319029310(real number)orks appear\n-Kills all of them in seconds and wants to take a brake\n-An ISIS pig carrying TNT(also called squig)comes out of nowhere\n-Titus accidently tries to melee him\n-Terrorist pig explodes and kills Titus\n-Titus dies happily shouting a quote\n\n10/10 I will serve the emperor again", "timestamp_created": 1472650848, "timestamp_updated": 1472650848, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 13, "weighted_vote_score": "0.466296613216400146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25194882", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009464720", "personaname": "Ramza8", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JoswaR/", "num_games_owned": 884, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 602, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 497, "last_played": 1472344692, "avatar": "53c5047805cd7299a6306372f742261612b34fa4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not much of an action gamer, but this game was astounding! It also motivated me to complete my Iron Hand army. \n", "timestamp_created": 1472345632, "timestamp_updated": 1472345632, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54712754487991333", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25157656", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047285869", "personaname": "jack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/beegul/", "num_games_owned": 251, "num_reviews": 113, "playtime_forever": 351, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 351, "last_played": 1472200005, "avatar": "baf3f1e4fe88fff5f7b21b537acda40c52ec0d56"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really enjoyed my playthrough of this game, it is a fantastic Hack and Slash/Third Person Shooter that starts at 100mph and doesn't really slow down. I don't really know much about Warhammer 40k, but this game introduced me to the different factions, what they stand for, and why they fight each other. This game is quite short, but if you want an adrenaline filled few hours of constant shooting and slaughtering, you need to buy this game.", "timestamp_created": 1472200280, "timestamp_updated": 1472200280, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.629268288612365723", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25140794", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028194851", "personaname": "BaronMcBoomBoom", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028194851/", "num_games_owned": 838, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 251, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 106, "last_played": 1737913761, "avatar": "bfe96bee249988838314c09b97e501cd40668295"}, "language": "english", "review": "In a word, meh.\n\nTake Gears of War, remove the cool story and the cover system, keep the godawful voice acting and boring stereotypical characters. Paint the Gears blue and the Locust green, et voila! Warhammer 40k: Space Marine! I wouldn't say its an utterly terrible game but it's certainly not a good one either. To be perfectly honest it just makes me want to play through Gears of War again. I'll probably finish the campaign despite this review but only because I reckon I'm already a third of the way through it after less than 2 hours and its better than watching paint dry for the evening... just", "timestamp_created": 1472162171, "timestamp_updated": 1472162171, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.26070442795753479", "comment_count": 13, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25130086", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973422286", "personaname": "Px15", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197973422286/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 525, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 525, "last_played": 1471389030, "avatar": "453923327810f36155f5f5e94358b790a073c30b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game! Hope they'll make a sequal :)", "timestamp_created": 1472123220, "timestamp_updated": 1472123220, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.548907876014709473", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}